---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { url, talk } from "../data/site";
---

<Layout title="About — Tarun Abraham">
  <div id="top" class="wrap about-content">
    <section class="page-intro">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="intro-text">
        I’m Tarun, a Year 13 student at Al Diyafah High School in Dubai. I like
        building things, understanding the systems behind them, and sharing what
        I find.
      </p>
    </section>
    <figure>
      <img
        class="about-photo"
        src={url("images/tedx.webp")}
        alt="Tarun receiving recognition at TEDxAl Diyafah High School"
        width="1380"
        height="965"
      />
      <figcaption class="photo-caption mono">
        <span>On the TEDxAl Diyafah High School stage</span>
        <a href={talk}>Watch the talk</a>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <section class="editorial-row">
      <h2 class="eyebrow">What draws me in</h2>
      <div class="body-copy">
        <p>
          Technology is a big part of my life. I’m interested in how it works,
          how it breaks, and what changes when people start using it. That has
          taken me from cybersecurity and configuring a Hackintosh to building
          Swift apps and an explainable football match studio.
        </p>
        <p>
          I like projects that give me a reason to learn something unfamiliar.
          Sometimes that means working through an API. Sometimes it means
          finding a clearer way to explain an idea to a room full of people.
        </p>
        <p>
          My current A levels are Mathematics, Economics, and Accounting. They
          bring another set of questions to the things I build: how systems
          behave, how decisions get made, and what the numbers actually tell us.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="leadership" class="editorial-row">
      <h2 class="eyebrow">Working with people</h2>
      <div class="body-copy">
        <h3>From debating to making things happen.</h3>
        <p>
          I’ve taken part in four editions of ADMUN as a delegate, co-chaired
          its House of Heroes committee, and now serve as Director of Logistics
          at ADMUN 2.7. I received an Honourable Mention at ADMUN 2.3 and
          Runner-Up Best Delegate at NMSMUN 2023.
        </p>
        <p class="small">
          The ADMUN 2.7 logistics role is an appointment for the forthcoming
          event, rather than a completed event outcome.
        </p>
        <h3>A place for students to try entrepreneurship.</h3>
        <p>
          As a founding core member of my school’s Entrepreneurial Club, I
          helped coordinate initiatives, prepare session content, and contribute
          to the NextGen Entrepreneurial League, an inter-school competition.
        </p>
        <h3 id="brainstormers">Brainstormers / Peter Jones Tycoon</h3>
        <p>
          I led Brainstormers in the Peter Jones Tycoon Business Enterprise
          Competition. Brainstormers was recognized as the winning business
          across the UAE that year.
        </p>
        <p id="wharton">
          I introduced the Wharton Global High School Investment Competition to
          my school, helped establish its first participating team, and led
          investment strategy and stock-selection planning against the
          competition brief.
        </p>
        <h3 id="sustainovation">Sustainovation Challenge</h3>
        <p>
          I took part in the Sustainovation Challenge hosted by De Montfort
          University and placed third.
        </p>
        <h3>Leadership in the everyday.</h3>
        <p>
          As a Year 11 Student Representative Council delegate, I worked with
          school leaders on student needs. I also helped co-organize a service
          learning programme supporting school staff with English and IT skills.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="photo-pair">
      <figure>
        <img
          src={url("images/mun.webp")}
          alt="ADMUN participants gathered on stage with country flags"
          width="1400"
          height="1000"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>Model United Nations / Al Diyafah High School</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <img
          src={url("images/entrepreneurs.webp")}
          alt="School entrepreneurial club members standing together at an event"
          width="1400"
          height="920"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>
          Entrepreneurial Club / building with other people
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <section class="editorial-row">
      <h2 class="eyebrow">Away from the screen</h2>
      <div class="body-copy">
        <h3>There is usually music involved.</h3>
        <p>
          I’m a vocalist, with Grade 8 Rock & Pop Vocals from Trinity College
          London. I also play guitar. Music and public speaking have given me
          different ways to work with an audience, listen closely, and find the
          confidence to put something out there.
        </p>
        <ul class="fact-list">
          <li>
            <span>Rock & Pop Vocals</span>
            <span>Grade 8 · Merit</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>Communication Skills</span>
            <span>Grade 7 · Distinction</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span>Guitar</span>
            <span>Grade 3 · Merit</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Learning to be useful.</h3>
        <p>
          In December 2025, I worked as a student intern at The Hive Drama and
          Performing Arts Center, helping with children in a busy environment.
          Through Ponnomanakal, I also hosted sensory activities for special
          needs teens and adults.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="editorial-row">
      <h2 class="eyebrow">A few foundations</h2>
      <div class="body-copy">
        <h3>Still a student. Still learning.</h3>
        <p>
          I received 3 A*s and 5 As in my 2025 IGCSEs and was recognized as an
          Academic Achiever. Alongside school, I’ve explored cybersecurity, AI,
          cloud storage, and professional skills through programmes from Cisco,
          IBM, Google Cloud, and Forage.
        </p>
        <p>
          Those are starting points. The projects are where I get to find out
          what I can actually do with what I’ve learned.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href={url("#work")}>
          Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
